s strong for planet g, so while there’s","words":[["observations","观测"],["was","曾"],["not","不"],["as","那么"],["strong","强"],["for","对"],["planet","行星"],["g,","g"],["so","所以"],["while","虽然"],["there’s","有"]]},{"start":98.73,"end":102.27,"text":"no evidence for a thick hydrogen-rich atmosphere on g,","words":[["no","没有"],["evidence","证据"],["for","对"],["a","一个"],["thick","厚"],["hydrogen-rich","富氢"],["atmosphere","大气"],["on","在"],["g,","g"]]},{"start":102.27,"end":106.21,"text":"the researchers are not yet ruling it out. Planets e, f, and","words":[["the","这"],["researchers","研究人员"],["are","是"],["not","不"],["yet","还"],["ruling","排除"],["it","它"],["out.","出"],["Planets","行星"],["e,","e"],["f,","f"],["and","和"]]},{"start":106.21,"end":108.88,"text":"g orbit at distances where temperatures would allow for","words":[["g","g"],["orbit","绕"],["at","在"],["distances","距离"],["where","那里"],["temperatures","温度"],["would","会"],["allow","允许"],["for",""]]},{"start":108.88,"end":113.11,"text":"liquid water, while d is likely a little too hot. Hubble has yet","words":[["liquid","液态"],["water,","水"],["while","而"],["d","d"],["is","是"],["likely","大概"],["a","一点"],["little","有点"],["too","太"],["hot.","热"],["Hubble","哈勃"],["has","有"],["yet","还"]]},{"start":113.11,"end":117.38,"text":"to take observations of planet h, which is outside the system’s","words":[["to","去"],["take","进行"],["observations","观测"],["of","的"],["planet","行星"],["h,","h"],["which","它"],["is","是"],["outside","外面"],["the","这"],["system’s","系统的"]]},{"start":117.38,"end":121.09,"text":"habitable zone. To summarize – Hubble has not seen evidence of","words":[["habitable","宜居"],["zone.","带"],["To","去"],["summarize","总结"],["–","–"],["Hubble","哈勃"],["has","有"],["not","没"],["seen","看到"],["evidence","证据"],["of","的"]]},{"start":121.09,"end":126.13,"text":"thick, hydrogen-rich atmospheres for planets b, c, d, e, and f,","words":[["thick,","厚"],["hydrogen-rich","富氢"],["atmospheres","大气"],["for","对"],["planets","行星"],["b,","b"],["c,","c"],["d,","d"],["e,","e"],["and","和"],["f,","f"]]},{"start":126.13,"end":130.56,"text":"and of those five planets, e and f are in the habitable zone.","words":[["and","和"],["of","的"],["those","那些"],["five","五颗"],["planets,","行星"],["e","e"],["and","和"],["f","f"],["are","是"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["habitable","宜居"],["zone.","带"]]},{"start":130.56,"end":134.27,"text":"Planet g needs more data, and Hubble has not yet looked at","words":[["Planet","行星"],["g","g"],["needs","需要"],["more","更多"],["data,","数据"],["and","和"],["Hubble","哈勃"],["has","有"],["not","没"],["yet","还"],["looked","看"],["at","在"]]},{"start":134.27,"end":137.1,"text":"planet h. It’s worth noting though, that even the planets","words":[["planet","行星"],["h.","h"],["It’s","它是"],["worth","值得"],["noting","注意"],["though,","不过"],["that","那"],["even","甚至"],["the","这"],["planets","行星"]]},{"start":137.1,"end":140.67,"text":"outside the habitable zone still might be able to have liquid","words":[["outside","外面"],["the","这"],["habitable","宜居"],["zone","带"],["still","仍"],["might","可能"],["be","是"],["able","能够"],["to","去"],["have","有"],["liquid","液态"]]},{"start":140.67,"end":144.34,"text":"water somewhere on its surface in certain conditions. It’s also","words":[["water","水"],["somewhere","某处"],["on","在"],["its","它的"],["surface","表面"],["in","在"],["certain","某些"],["conditions.","条件"],["It’s","它是"],["also","也"]]},{"start":144.34,"end":146.98,"text":"worth noting that if any of these planets have high-altitude","words":[["worth","值得"],["noting","注意"],["that","那"],["if","如果"],["any","任何"],["of","的"],["these","这些"],["planets","行星"],["have","有"],["high-altitude","高空"]]},{"start":146.98,"end":150.65,"text":"clouds and hazes, that would block Hubble’s ability to detect","words":[["clouds","云"],["and","和"],["hazes,","雾霾"],["that","那"],["would","会"],["block","挡住"],["Hubble’s","哈勃的"],["ability","能力"],["to","去"],["detect","探测"]]},{"start":150.65,"end":153.39,"text":"a thick, hydrogen-rich atmosphere, but such an","words":[["a","一个"],["thick,","厚"],["hydrogen-rich","富氢"],["atmosphere,","大气"],["but","但"],["such","这样"],["an","一个"]]},{"start":153.39,"end":156.82,"text":"atmosphere is not likely to exist on these planets. Many","words":[["atmosphere","大气"],["is","是"],["not","不"],["likely","可能"],["to","去"],["exist","存在"],["on","在"],["these","这些"],["planets.","行星"],["Many","许多"]]},{"start":156.82,"end":159.43,"text":"possibilities remain for what types of atmospheres these","words":[["possibilities","可能性"],["remain","留着"],["for","对"],["what","什么"],["types","种类"],["of","的"],["atmospheres","大气"],["these","这些"]]},{"start":159.43,"end":163.33,"text":"planets have, or whether they even have atmospheres. The","words":[["planets","行星"],["have,","有"],["or","或"],["whether","是否"],["they","它们"],["even","甚至"],["have","有"],["atmospheres.","大气"],["The","这"]]},{"start":163.33,"end":166.53,"text":"TRAPPIST-1 planets could have compact atmospheres similar to","words":[["TRAPPIST-1","TRAPPIST-1"],["planets","行星"],["could","可能"],["have","有"],["compact","致密"],["atmospheres","大气"],["similar","相似"],["to","于"]]},{"start":166.53,"end":171.67,"text":"Mars, Venus, Earth, or something entirely different. Researchers","words":[["Mars,","火星"],["Venus,","金星"],["Earth,","地球"],["or","或"],["something","某种"],["entirely","完全"],["different.","不同"],["Researchers","研究人员"]]},{"start":171.67,"end":174.61,"text":"hope to use Hubble’s ultraviolet capabilities to look for","words":[["hope","希望"],["to","去"],["use","用"],["Hubble’s","哈勃的"],["ultraviolet","紫外"],["capabilities","能力"],["to","去"],["look","寻找"],["for",""]]},{"start":174.61,"end":177.68,"text":"evidence of water vapor or methane, and NASA’s upcoming","words":[["evidence","证据"],["of","的"],["water","水"],["vapor","蒸气"],["or","或"],["methane,","甲烷"],["and","和"],["NASA’s","NASA的"],["upcoming","即将到来的"]]},{"start":177.68,"end":180.81,"text":"James Webb Space Telescope will look in the far-infrared to","words":[["James","詹姆斯"],["Webb","韦布"],["Space","空间"],["Telescope","望远镜"],["will","将"],["look","看"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["far-infrared","远红外"],["to","去"]]},{"start":180.81,"end":184.18,"text":"further characterize these atmospheres. Future telescopes","words":[["further","进一步"],["characterize","刻画"],["these","这些"],["atmospheres.","大气"],["Future","未来"],["telescopes","望远镜"]]},{"start":184.18,"end":186.39,"text":"also hope to look for hints of whether the planets are","words":[["also","也"],["hope","希望"],["to","去"],["look","寻找"],["for",""],["hints","线索"],["of","的"],["whether","是否"],["the","这"],["planets","行星"],["are","是"]]},{"start":186.39,"end":190.69,"text":"habitable and if life could be present. The TRAPPIST-1 system","words":[["habitable","宜居"],["and","和"],["if","如果"],["life","生命"],["could","能"],["be","是"],["present.","存在"],["The","这"],["TRAPPIST-1","TRAPPIST-1"],["system","系统"]]},{"start":190.69,"end":194.29,"text":"provides the best opportunity we currently have to study","words":[["provides","提供"],["the","这"],["best","最好"],["opportunity","机会"],["we","我们"],["currently","目前"],["have","有"],["to","去"],["study","研究"]]},{"start":194.29,"end":198.3,"text":"Earth-size exoplanets. Over the next few years, Hubble and other","words":[["Earth-size","地球大小的"],["exoplanets.","系外行星"],["Over","在"],["the","这"],["next","接下来"],["few","几"],["years,","年"],["Hubble","哈勃"],["and","和"],["other","其他"]]},{"start":198.3,"end":201.57,"text":"telescopes will work together, each contributing important","words":[["telescopes","望远镜"],["will","将"],["work","工作"],["together,","一起"],["each","每个"],["contributing","贡献"],["important","重要的"]]},{"start":201.57,"end":205.67,"text":"observations. For the first time ever, we’ll have an in-depth","words":[["observations.","观测"],["For","为"],["the","这"],["first","第一"],["time","次"],["ever,","曾经"],["we’ll","我们将"],["have","有"],["an","一个"],["in-depth","深入的"]]},{"start":205.68,"end":209.42,"text":"understanding of a set of terrestrial planets outside our","words":[["understanding","理解"],["of","的"],["a","一"],["set","组"],["of","的"],["terrestrial","类地"],["planets","行星"],["outside","外面"],["our","我们的"]]},{"start":209.42,"end":210.62,"text":"solar system.","words":[["solar","太阳"],["system.","系"]]},{"start":211.88,"end":217.88,"text":"www.nasa.gov/hubble @NASAHubble","words":[["www.nasa.gov/hubble","网址"],["@NASAHubble","账号"]]}]}